279
00:27:16,771 --> 00:27:18,646
No, you're not.

280
00:27:18,729 --> 00:27:19,937
No, I'm not.

281
00:27:23,146 --> 00:27:24,812
How long are you staying?

282
00:27:24,896 --> 00:27:26,146
As long as I need to.

283
00:27:27,604 --> 00:27:29,979
You have help now,

284
00:27:30,062 --> 00:27:32,771
so you don't need to worry
about anything.

285
00:27:34,604 --> 00:27:36,854
You have been thinking
about her.

286
00:27:37,521 --> 00:27:39,104
Every day.

287
00:27:40,354 --> 00:27:41,854
Me too.

288
00:27:46,854 --> 00:27:49,146
So why are you here?

289
00:27:56,396 --> 00:27:58,896
Where did you find
this inscription?

290
00:28:00,479 --> 00:28:03,187
Why didn't you wait
for me to get back?

291
00:28:03,271 --> 00:28:07,354
We could've discussed it,
figured out something together.

292
00:28:09,104 --> 00:28:13,021
Where is it, Evelyn?
I know you have it.

293
00:28:13,104 --> 00:28:14,396
No.

294
00:28:14,479 --> 00:28:15,580
Nobody else knows
where we buried it.

295
00:28:15,604 --> 00:28:18,062
No. No.

296
00:28:18,146 --> 00:28:20,354
- Why would you take it?
- No.

297
00:28:20,437 --> 00:28:24,229
If it's for this,
you know what can happen.

298
00:28:24,979 --> 00:28:26,646
- Where is it?
- Hey.

299
00:28:26,729 --> 00:28:27,729
Go away.

300
00:28:27,812 --> 00:28:28,937
I'm trying to protect you!

301
00:28:29,021 --> 00:28:31,437
- No.
- Hey! Don't touch her.

302
00:28:31,521 --> 00:28:34,646
Leave me, leave me,
leave me alone.

303
00:28:36,521 --> 00:28:38,062
Go away.

304
00:28:38,146 --> 00:28:41,021
You need to leave.
Now.

305
00:28:46,729 --> 00:28:48,187
Make him go. Make him go.

306
00:28:48,271 --> 00:28:49,437
Okay.

307
00:28:49,521 --> 00:28:50,521
Make sure he leaves.

308
00:28:50,604 --> 00:28:51,812
I promise.

309
00:28:52,646 --> 00:28:54,646
I don't wanna see him.

310
00:28:54,729 --> 00:28:57,021
If you don't get out
of this house in 30 seconds,

311
00:28:57,104 --> 00:28:59,729
I'm calling the police.
I don't care who you are.

312
00:29:03,021 --> 00:29:05,771
You have no idea
what's going on here.

313
00:29:11,687 --> 00:29:12,729
Yeah.

314
00:29:12,812 --> 00:29:14,187
It's gonna be okay, all right?

315
00:29:14,271 --> 00:29:16,937
Please, please get rid of him.

316
00:29:17,021 --> 00:29:18,937
I never wanna see him again.

317
00:29:19,021 --> 00:29:21,021
All right, just... just calm down.

318
00:29:21,104 --> 00:29:22,521
I'll be right back.

319
00:29:26,604 --> 00:29:28,646
Where are you hiding it?

320
00:29:28,729 --> 00:29:31,396
Hey! Get out!

321
00:29:51,771 --> 00:29:53,646
Just leave!

322
00:29:55,604 --> 00:29:58,021
Watch yourself.

323
00:30:43,979 --> 00:30:47,104
Evelyn, what are you doing?
It's freezing.

324
00:30:49,479 --> 00:30:51,937
I wanna be out here when I pass.

325
00:30:53,104 --> 00:30:55,604
Let's not talk about
that. You've still got time.

326
00:30:57,771 --> 00:31:00,479
Why would anyone
want a job like this?

327
00:31:01,729 --> 00:31:04,646
Why would you want to
watch someone die?

328
00:31:06,271 --> 00:31:08,521
Because no one
should have to die alone.

329
00:31:10,229 --> 00:31:12,229
We all die alone.

330
00:31:13,354 --> 00:31:15,021
What was that all
about up there?

331
00:31:16,104 --> 00:31:20,146
Oh, we don't agree on
things. We never did, really.

332
00:31:21,354 --> 00:31:25,021
I tried to get him
to understand but he... he blames me.

333
00:31:26,854 --> 00:31:28,479
What happened to Sarah?

334
00:31:30,604 --> 00:31:34,479
Oh, Sarah.
I miss her so much.

335
00:31:37,521 --> 00:31:39,271
Can't hide from our past.

336
00:31:39,354 --> 00:31:42,771
Sometimes we have
to confront it and accept it.

337
00:31:45,021 --> 00:31:46,146
Is everything okay?

338
00:31:46,229 --> 00:31:48,271
I'm going to be sick.

339
00:31:48,354 --> 00:31:50,812
Come on, let's go inside.

340
00:31:56,521 --> 00:31:58,896
Oh, dear. Come here.

341
00:32:02,104 --> 00:32:04,021
Ugh, oh, I'm so sorry.

342
00:32:04,104 --> 00:32:06,396
No, it's okay. It's fine.

343
00:32:06,479 --> 00:32:09,562
Let's get you cleaned up, okay?
I'll find you a blanket.

344
00:32:24,521 --> 00:32:25,562
All right.

345
00:32:32,021 --> 00:32:33,979
Evelyn?

346
00:32:41,729 --> 00:32:44,562
Oh, my... Evelyn?

347
00:32:45,979 --> 00:32:47,812
Evelyn, what are you doing?

348
00:32:49,646 --> 00:32:50,687
Stop that, please.

349
00:32:59,479 --> 00:33:00,646
Evelyn!

350
00:33:06,229 --> 00:33:07,729
Stop.

351
00:33:14,229 --> 00:33:15,396
Eve...

352
00:33:24,771 --> 00:33:26,937
Jesus Christ.

353
00:33:27,729 --> 00:33:29,812
<i>It's not working.</i>

354
00:33:29,896 --> 00:33:33,062
<i>The song will work. It always works.</i>

355
00:33:33,146 --> 00:33:34,146
<i>Brush my hair.</i>

356
00:33:34,229 --> 00:33:35,604
<i>What the fuck is this?</i>

357
00:33:35,687 --> 00:33:37,146
<i>Sure, my love.</i>

358
00:33:39,396 --> 00:33:42,271
<i>It don't feel so good. My tummy hurts.</i>

359
00:33:43,562 --> 00:33:45,396
<i>Do you want me to rub your tummy?</i>

360
00:33:47,646 --> 00:33:48,979
<i>Mom?</i>

361
00:33:49,062 --> 00:33:50,646
<i>What is it?</i>

362
00:33:50,729 --> 00:33:52,687
<i>Why do you have that?</i>

363
00:33:52,771 --> 00:33:54,521
<i>Oh, this?</i>

364
00:33:54,604 --> 00:33:56,896
<i>Are you taping me?</i>

365
00:33:56,979 --> 00:33:59,812
- <i>I...</i>
- Where the fuck am I?

366
00:33:59,896 --> 00:34:01,997
<i>I was... I was worried about
you and wanted to record</i>

367
00:34:02,021 --> 00:34:03,396
<i>any changes.</i>

368
00:34:03,479 --> 00:34:05,812
<i>Changes?</i>

369
00:34:05,896 --> 00:34:08,562
<i>Sorry, I should've
asked you. I'll turn it off.</i>

370
00:34:10,354 --> 00:34:11,896
<i>Is it off?</i>

371
00:34:11,979 --> 00:34:13,229
<i>Yes.</i>

372
00:34:15,146 --> 00:34:16,562
<i>Don't ever do that again!</i>

373
00:34:16,646 --> 00:34:18,187
Shit.

374
00:34:18,271 --> 00:34:19,521
<i>Sarah?</i>

375
00:34:19,604 --> 00:34:21,146
<i>Get out!</i>

376
00:34:23,604 --> 00:34:25,021
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

377
00:34:42,396 --> 00:34:43,812
Okay.

378
00:34:52,479 --> 00:34:54,896
Oh, my God, Evelyn,
what did you do?

379
00:35:12,312 --> 00:35:14,021
What the hell?

380
00:35:28,854 --> 00:35:30,396
What is this?

381
00:36:34,604 --> 00:36:36,104
Hello?

382
00:37:00,479 --> 00:37:03,271
What... What is...

383
00:37:11,979 --> 00:37:13,771
What the fuck?

384
00:37:25,896 --> 00:37:28,271
Is there a back door?

385
00:37:28,354 --> 00:37:30,229
I think I can open it.

386
00:37:31,354 --> 00:37:33,229
Pete!

387
00:37:33,312 --> 00:37:34,687
Go check upstairs.

388
00:37:34,771 --> 00:37:36,604
Sh... shit.

389
00:37:37,854 --> 00:37:38,854
Oh!

390
00:38:08,979 --> 00:38:10,979
Office is clear.

391
00:38:14,146 --> 00:38:16,021
Kitchen's clear.

392
00:38:18,104 --> 00:38:20,771
Evelyn, where are you?
I just want to talk!

393
00:38:40,271 --> 00:38:41,729
Okay.

394
00:39:33,604 --> 00:39:34,604
Hey.

395
00:39:35,604 --> 00:39:38,521
Oh, fuck! Oh!

396
00:39:42,646 --> 00:39:44,021
Calm down.

397
00:39:44,104 --> 00:39:46,229
Where do I go?
Where the fuck do I go?

398
00:39:48,104 --> 00:39:49,396
Shit!

399
00:39:53,729 --> 00:39:56,437
Okay, okay.

400
00:39:56,521 --> 00:39:58,062
Just find something.

401
00:39:58,146 --> 00:39:59,521
There's gotta be something
in here.

402
00:39:59,604 --> 00:40:02,729
Okay. Find scissors.

403
00:40:03,979 --> 00:40:05,021
Okay.

404
00:40:05,104 --> 00:40:07,229
Shit.
Fucking...

405
00:40:09,104 --> 00:40:11,229
Fucking shit!

406
00:40:13,021 --> 00:40:14,187
She blinded me, man.

407
00:40:14,271 --> 00:40:15,646
Yeah, well.

408
00:40:15,729 --> 00:40:16,771
- I'm scared.
- Quiet!

409
00:40:16,854 --> 00:40:18,271
It fucking burns!

410
00:40:18,354 --> 00:40:20,312
Hey, man up!
You grab him.

411
00:40:20,396 --> 00:40:21,771
I can't look
for anyone right now.

412
00:40:21,854 --> 00:40:22,771
Hey, shut up. All right?

413
00:40:22,854 --> 00:40:25,021
Just be quiet.

414
00:40:25,104 --> 00:40:26,646
We just want to talk.

415
00:40:26,729 --> 00:40:28,271
We're running out of time.

416
00:40:28,354 --> 00:40:30,646
Give me a minute.
Go downstairs.

417
00:40:32,354 --> 00:40:35,187
I'm not gonna hurt anybody.
Can we talk?

418
00:40:35,271 --> 00:40:36,437
I'd like to explain.

419
00:40:36,521 --> 00:40:37,896
Stay away!

420
00:40:37,979 --> 00:40:39,646
This is not how
I wanted this to go.

421
00:40:39,729 --> 00:40:41,937
How did you want this to go?

422
00:40:42,021 --> 00:40:43,646
This is a misunderstanding.

423
00:40:43,729 --> 00:40:45,896
Just leave us alone!

424
00:40:46,729 --> 00:40:48,689
You can stay in there
if it makes you feel better.

425
00:40:48,729 --> 00:40:50,521
It does.

426
00:40:50,604 --> 00:40:52,229
Evelyn's in trouble.
Where is she?

427
00:40:52,312 --> 00:40:53,604
I don't know!

428
00:40:53,687 --> 00:40:55,646
And I wouldn't tell you
if I did.

429
00:40:55,729 --> 00:40:57,062
Is she still in the house?

430
00:40:57,146 --> 00:40:59,521
What the fuck did I just say?

431
00:40:59,604 --> 00:41:03,271
Nothing I can tell you will
make you believe me.

432
00:41:03,354 --> 00:41:06,271
Hell, I didn't believe it myself
and I lived through it.

433
00:41:06,354 --> 00:41:07,646
Through what?

434
00:41:08,979 --> 00:41:10,604
We had a child.

435
00:41:12,729 --> 00:41:15,021
She died because
we couldn't protect her.

436
00:41:16,687 --> 00:41:18,229
That's a lie.

437
00:41:18,312 --> 00:41:21,229
We could've protected her,
but we got careless.

438
00:41:22,229 --> 00:41:25,687
We thought we knew better
and it destroyed us.

439
00:41:25,771 --> 00:41:28,562
Evelyn never forgave herself
and...

440
00:41:28,646 --> 00:41:30,479
And what?

441
00:41:31,479 --> 00:41:33,437
She was my first love, you know?

442
00:41:33,521 --> 00:41:35,146
Randall, we got her!

443
00:41:35,229 --> 00:41:36,896
Just leave her alone!

444
00:41:36,979 --> 00:41:39,896
I'm sorry.
This is for your own good.

445
00:41:42,521 --> 00:41:43,812
Let me out!

446
00:41:54,104 --> 00:41:57,979
Randall, Peter, we got her.

447
00:41:59,771 --> 00:42:00,979
Calm down.

448
00:42:01,062 --> 00:42:03,437
Get out of my house!

449
00:42:03,521 --> 00:42:05,521
Take a deep breath. Calm down.

450
00:42:05,604 --> 00:42:06,646
Don't touch me.

451
00:42:06,729 --> 00:42:08,521
Everything is gonna be okay.

452
00:42:08,604 --> 00:42:11,521
Of course, it's you. Stay away.

453
00:42:11,604 --> 00:42:14,854
Peter, give her some space.

454
00:42:17,604 --> 00:42:21,729
Evelyn, put that down.
You shouldn't be touching that.

455
00:42:23,354 --> 00:42:26,771
Please, hand it over, Evie.

456
00:42:29,104 --> 00:42:30,521
Let me take it off your hands.

457
00:42:30,604 --> 00:42:32,687
I just want to put it
someplace safe.

458
00:42:32,771 --> 00:42:35,937
There is no place safe.

459
00:42:36,021 --> 00:42:38,062
It was safe until you started
messing with it.

460
00:42:38,146 --> 00:42:39,312
Why, Evie?

461
00:42:39,396 --> 00:42:42,521
Because I miss her!

462
00:42:42,604 --> 00:42:44,312
I'm sorry about
the way things turned out.

463
00:42:44,396 --> 00:42:46,771
Yeah, you left me
right after she died

464
00:42:46,854 --> 00:42:48,854
when I needed you the most.

465
00:42:50,062 --> 00:42:52,146
What do you want me to say?

466
00:42:52,229 --> 00:42:54,271
That I couldn't face you after?

467
00:42:54,354 --> 00:42:57,396
That the... the guilt
ate me up inside?

468
00:42:57,479 --> 00:43:00,479
I got it wrong and I've had
to live with that.

469
00:43:02,229 --> 00:43:03,562
But I can do it right this time.

470
00:43:03,646 --> 00:43:05,771
I know how. Trust me.

471
00:43:05,854 --> 00:43:07,646
Trust you?

472
00:43:07,729 --> 00:43:09,771
That's what got her killed.

473
00:43:10,729 --> 00:43:13,812
I translated one of the words
that you sent me.

474
00:43:15,229 --> 00:43:17,646
It's an incantation, isn't it?

475
00:43:17,729 --> 00:43:19,396
Tell me!

476
00:43:19,479 --> 00:43:21,354
We can still do the right thing.

477
00:43:22,354 --> 00:43:25,896
That's your weakness, always
wanting to do the right thing,

478
00:43:25,979 --> 00:43:30,646
huh, when there's only pain
and loss and suffering.

479
00:43:30,729 --> 00:43:33,646
This is not going
to bring Sarah back!

480
00:43:34,854 --> 00:43:36,354
Give it to me!

481
00:43:37,062 --> 00:43:42,604
Why?
So you can bury me again?

482
00:43:42,687 --> 00:43:45,646
Who... who am I talking to right now?

483
00:43:45,729 --> 00:43:48,354
What have you done with Evelyn?

484
00:43:48,437 --> 00:43:51,229
I wear her like a coat.

485
00:44:06,187 --> 00:44:07,396
Oh, my God.

486
00:44:07,479 --> 00:44:08,479
Let's get outta here.

487
00:44:08,562 --> 00:44:10,479
Oh, let's call the others.

488
00:44:10,562 --> 00:44:12,562
Get out, quick, quick.

489
00:46:06,104 --> 00:46:09,979
Evelyn? Evelyn?

490
00:46:14,437 --> 00:46:16,812
Oh, my God,
what did they do to you?

491
00:46:17,812 --> 00:46:19,312
They're gone now.

492
00:46:20,229 --> 00:46:23,729
Let's get you changed.
Oh, my goodness.

493
00:46:23,812 --> 00:46:27,229
Here we go.
Where are you hurt?

494
00:46:29,187 --> 00:46:32,021
Oh, look at your hand.
What did they do to you?

495
00:46:32,104 --> 00:46:36,062
Okay, let's... let's sit here.
Yeah, there you go.

496
00:46:38,354 --> 00:46:39,604
- Want to give me that?
- No.

497
00:46:39,687 --> 00:46:41,479
Wash your hands, okay?

498
00:46:41,562 --> 00:46:43,479
Okay. Okay. Here we go.

499
00:46:45,354 --> 00:46:49,396
All right. There you go.

500
00:46:50,854 --> 00:46:52,854
Got this one.
That's great.

501
00:46:56,312 --> 00:46:57,979
Where's your phone?

502
00:46:58,062 --> 00:47:00,187
- In the office.
- Okay.

503
00:47:01,604 --> 00:47:05,479
We'll find it, yeah?
You'll be okay.

504
00:47:05,562 --> 00:47:07,104
Yeah.

505
00:47:09,229 --> 00:47:10,812
Here we are. All right.

506
00:47:12,187 --> 00:47:14,312
Okay, you good?

507
00:47:14,396 --> 00:47:18,187
- Yeah, I'm fine.
- All right. Here we are.

508
00:47:23,229 --> 00:47:27,062
All right.
Let's sit right here.

509
00:47:27,146 --> 00:47:28,812
Where is it?

510
00:47:29,979 --> 00:47:33,021
Okay, great.

511
00:47:33,104 --> 00:47:34,896
For fuck's sake!

512
00:47:36,437 --> 00:47:38,187
What do they want?

513
00:47:40,021 --> 00:47:42,479
What... this?
What... what is it?

514
00:47:42,562 --> 00:47:44,604
Is it worth a lot of money?

515
00:47:50,062 --> 00:47:51,479
This is not...

516
00:47:53,979 --> 00:47:56,354
You should be surrounded
by loved ones,

517
00:47:56,437 --> 00:47:58,312
not by someone like me.

518
00:48:01,687 --> 00:48:04,562
<i>Sarah, if you ever get to hear this,</i>

519
00:48:04,646 --> 00:48:08,021
<i>your suffering is because of us.</i>

520
00:48:08,104 --> 00:48:10,979
<i>Too many risks.</i>

521
00:48:11,062 --> 00:48:13,604
<i>Too much contact
with the other side.</i>

522
00:48:13,687 --> 00:48:15,812
<i>We have to bury her.</i>

523
00:48:15,896 --> 00:48:18,354
<i>I'm sorry we put all this ahead of you.</i>

524
00:48:18,437 --> 00:48:20,937
<i>I'll never expose you
to this again.</i>

525
00:48:21,979 --> 00:48:23,562
<i>What's wrong with us?</i>

526
00:48:23,646 --> 00:48:26,354
<i>Okay. Father, start the prayer.</i>

527
00:48:28,479 --> 00:48:30,604
<i>I'm sorry. It was meant for...</i>

528
00:48:30,687 --> 00:48:32,104
<i>Stop, stop. Please don't do this.</i>

529
00:48:32,187 --> 00:48:34,187
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

530
00:48:34,271 --> 00:48:35,604
Is that...

531
00:48:35,687 --> 00:48:37,062
<i>Help me. Mommy!</i>

532
00:48:37,146 --> 00:48:38,562
- Your baby?
<i>- No, mommy, please.</i>

533
00:48:38,646 --> 00:48:40,146
<i>She's not okay.</i>

534
00:48:40,229 --> 00:48:41,562
<i>She will be fine.</i>

535
00:48:41,646 --> 00:48:43,062
<i>Stop! Stop!</i>

536
00:48:43,146 --> 00:48:44,646
<i>She'll look in the box.</i>

537
00:48:44,729 --> 00:48:45,729
<i>What... what is this?</i>

538
00:48:48,937 --> 00:48:50,146
<i>Look at her!</i>

539
00:48:50,229 --> 00:48:51,604
<i>Help!</i>

540
00:48:53,354 --> 00:48:54,896
<i>Stop! Stop! Stop!</i>

541
00:48:54,979 --> 00:48:56,479
<i>There he is.</i>

542
00:48:56,562 --> 00:48:58,229
<i>Get off!</i>

543
00:48:58,312 --> 00:49:00,062
<i>We've got to bury the de...</i>

544
00:49:00,562 --> 00:49:02,396
Let's get you warmed up.

545
00:49:11,187 --> 00:49:13,896
I brought her to evil.

546
00:49:13,979 --> 00:49:16,437
It's my fault.

547
00:49:16,521 --> 00:49:18,937
- It's all my fault.
- Don't say that.

548
00:49:21,687 --> 00:49:23,354
It's true.

549
00:49:23,437 --> 00:49:26,854
All right. You're okay.

550
00:49:26,937 --> 00:49:28,354
Okay.

551
00:49:28,437 --> 00:49:30,771
No, no. I don't want it.

552
00:49:30,854 --> 00:49:32,312
Okay.

553
00:49:39,562 --> 00:49:42,937
Nice, nice, nice, nice, nice.
You feeling better?

554
00:49:45,562 --> 00:49:46,562
This one's nice.

555
00:49:53,187 --> 00:49:54,854
Things happen, Evelyn.

556
00:49:54,937 --> 00:49:57,312
I'm sure you and Randall
were great parents.

557
00:49:59,187 --> 00:50:01,187
You don't know that.

558
00:50:03,437 --> 00:50:06,187
I know I blamed myself
for my mom's death.

559
00:50:08,187 --> 00:50:12,729
I mean, I know,
I didn't make her sick,

560
00:50:12,812 --> 00:50:16,979
but I... I should've been there
for her, and I... I just... I...

561
00:50:17,062 --> 00:50:18,437
I couldn't do it.

562
00:50:20,437 --> 00:50:23,229
It's easier to take care
of strangers.

563
00:50:23,312 --> 00:50:24,396
Hmm.

564
00:50:27,312 --> 00:50:30,729
Fuck's sake.
Just stay here.

565
00:50:32,062 --> 00:50:33,729
I just want to talk!

566
00:50:35,229 --> 00:50:37,562
Please just don't move!

567
00:50:42,312 --> 00:50:43,604
I called the cops!

568
00:50:43,687 --> 00:50:45,479
You need to get
the fuck outta here now!

569
00:50:45,562 --> 00:50:46,896
Listen to me.

570
00:50:47,937 --> 00:50:51,354
I know it's confusing, but...
but that's not Evelyn in there.

571
00:50:51,437 --> 00:50:53,312
It's something dangerous.

572
00:50:53,396 --> 00:50:55,796
The only dangerous thing here
is you and your psycho friends!

573
00:50:55,854 --> 00:50:58,729
She killed Peter!
He's dead because of her!

574
00:50:58,812 --> 00:51:01,729
She didn't kill anybody!
She's fucking old!

575
00:51:02,937 --> 00:51:04,604
Stay the fuck back!

576
00:51:06,687 --> 00:51:09,104
That little ivory statue
that she has,

577
00:51:09,187 --> 00:51:11,854
you're not safe as long
as that thing is in the house.

578
00:51:11,937 --> 00:51:13,896
The statue is the problem?

579
00:51:13,979 --> 00:51:16,771
It's an anchor, a vessel
for something dark.

580
00:51:16,854 --> 00:51:18,354
It's attached itself to her.

581
00:51:18,437 --> 00:51:20,229
What the fuck
are you talking about?

582
00:51:20,312 --> 00:51:23,354
It'll kill you both!
We can't leave here without...

583
00:51:23,437 --> 00:51:24,812
Okay, fine!

584
00:51:24,896 --> 00:51:26,521
If I get it for you,
will you leave?

585
00:51:26,604 --> 00:51:28,604
Yes.
That's all we want!

586
00:51:28,687 --> 00:51:30,812
Just stay outside.
I'll go get it!

587
00:51:31,479 --> 00:51:33,229
You're doing the right thing.

588
00:51:39,562 --> 00:51:42,104
You think you can
take this from me?

589
00:51:42,187 --> 00:51:43,479
Huh?

590
00:51:44,396 --> 00:51:47,604
For fuck's sake, Evelyn, I
told you to stay over there!

591
00:51:47,687 --> 00:51:48,729
Put the knife down!

592
00:51:48,812 --> 00:51:51,271
No!

593
00:51:51,354 --> 00:51:52,687
Please, let's talk.

594
00:51:52,771 --> 00:51:55,646
Maybe we can work
something out with them.

595
00:51:55,729 --> 00:51:58,104
Evelyn, everything's
gonna be okay.

596
00:51:58,187 --> 00:51:59,413
You're safe.
Why don't you just give me...

597
00:51:59,437 --> 00:52:02,604
No! No!

598
00:52:03,854 --> 00:52:05,854
Evelyn, stop!

599
00:52:05,937 --> 00:52:07,854
You, stop!

600
00:52:07,937 --> 00:52:09,937
Evelyn, stop.

601
00:52:13,979 --> 00:52:15,354
Where are you?

602
00:52:20,979 --> 00:52:22,812
Fuck.

603
00:52:34,937 --> 00:52:36,604
Evelyn?

604
00:52:48,271 --> 00:52:49,812
Hello?

605
00:54:22,229 --> 00:54:23,854
Hurry up!

606
00:54:25,229 --> 00:54:26,146
Come on.

607
00:54:26,229 --> 00:54:27,687
You're here.

608
00:54:30,062 --> 00:54:32,979
We can still salvage this.
Trust me.

609
00:54:33,062 --> 00:54:34,562
Like Peter did?

610
00:54:36,271 --> 00:54:37,562
What is this?

611
00:54:37,646 --> 00:54:38,979
What are we dealing
with, Randall?

612
00:54:39,062 --> 00:54:40,937
Nothing I can't handle.

613
00:54:49,479 --> 00:54:50,854
What happened?

614
00:54:50,937 --> 00:54:54,062
We were too late.
It's already in her.

615
00:54:55,187 --> 00:54:57,812
We lost Peter,
there was nothing we could do.

616
00:54:59,312 --> 00:55:01,396
We need to get it
into the statue

617
00:55:01,479 --> 00:55:03,229
and back in here.

618
00:55:06,687 --> 00:55:10,229
Randall, this is very dangerous.

619
00:55:10,312 --> 00:55:11,788
It's not because
I'm no longer authorized.

620
00:55:11,812 --> 00:55:13,354
It's...

621
00:55:13,437 --> 00:55:15,896
You remember what happened
last time we tried this?

622
00:55:15,979 --> 00:55:18,354
You're all I've got.

623
00:55:18,437 --> 00:55:20,687
I'm not gonna lose both of them.

624
00:55:22,021 --> 00:55:23,396
I understand.

625
00:55:23,479 --> 00:55:27,521
Randall, this one,
this one is strong.

626
00:55:27,604 --> 00:55:30,687
Stronger than anything
we ever faced before and you know it.

627
00:55:31,354 --> 00:55:33,729
- This time is different.
- What's this?

628
00:55:33,812 --> 00:55:37,646
We can destroy it.
We only need one word.

629
00:55:37,729 --> 00:55:41,312
This is an incantation
of the blood of Christ.

630
00:55:42,687 --> 00:55:45,854
Blood of Christ.
Evelyn figured it out.

631
00:55:46,937 --> 00:55:49,021
No more hiding it away.

632
00:55:49,104 --> 00:55:52,479
I can finally make it pay
for everything that it's done.

633
00:55:52,562 --> 00:55:54,771
Send it back to hell
where it belongs.

634
00:55:54,854 --> 00:55:59,771
Hey, if this time
it doesn't work?

635
00:55:59,854 --> 00:56:02,604
We're going through the front.

636
00:56:02,687 --> 00:56:05,604
Stick together, near the back.

637
00:56:05,687 --> 00:56:09,479
Holler if you see her.

638
00:56:09,562 --> 00:56:13,354
Don't do anything
until I'm there.

639
00:56:14,812 --> 00:56:16,312
Go on.

640
00:56:18,562 --> 00:56:20,396
I'm going to fix this.

641
00:56:32,062 --> 00:56:34,187
She's stronger than she looks.

642
00:56:35,937 --> 00:56:39,062
If it goes south, just run out.

643
00:56:46,104 --> 00:56:49,312
Evelyn, is that you?

644
00:56:58,854 --> 00:57:02,146
<i>Honey, do you know why you're here?</i>

645
00:57:03,729 --> 00:57:06,854
<i>Why... why are my hands tied?</i>
- What the hell?

646
00:57:06,937 --> 00:57:10,021
<i>So you don't hurt yourself again.</i>

647
00:57:10,104 --> 00:57:12,021
<i>Remember last night?</i>

648
00:57:12,104 --> 00:57:14,271
<i>No.</i>

649
00:57:14,354 --> 00:57:16,604
<i>You scratched until your face bled.</i>

650
00:57:16,687 --> 00:57:18,854
<i>Stop it.</i>

651
00:57:20,729 --> 00:57:22,271
<i>How do you feel?</i>

652
00:57:22,354 --> 00:57:24,187
<i>My tummy really hurts.</i>

653
00:57:27,687 --> 00:57:30,521
<i>I don't feel good.</i>

654
00:57:30,604 --> 00:57:32,937
<i>Do you remember when we went on the dig?</i>

655
00:57:36,104 --> 00:57:37,979
<i>Do you remember
what school you go to?</i>

656
00:57:38,062 --> 00:57:40,979
<i>No! No!</i>

657
00:57:41,062 --> 00:57:43,146
<i>What do you remember?</i>

658
00:57:43,229 --> 00:57:44,771
<i>No. Mommy!</i>

659
00:57:44,854 --> 00:57:46,937
<i>Sarah?</i>

660
00:57:47,021 --> 00:57:49,021
<i>I pray the soul is another body to take.</i>

661
00:57:49,104 --> 00:57:51,437
<i>I only remember
that you're a shit mother!</i>

662
00:57:51,521 --> 00:57:52,812
<i>Sarah! -</i>

663
00:57:52,896 --> 00:57:53,896
<i>Randall!</i>

664
00:57:55,437 --> 00:57:57,312
<i>Oh, my God.</i>

665
00:57:57,396 --> 00:57:58,812
<i>Is that all you've got, old man?</i>

666
00:57:58,896 --> 00:58:00,187
<i>Hmm?</i>

667
00:58:00,271 --> 00:58:01,854
<i>Stop it!</i>

668
00:58:01,937 --> 00:58:03,312
<i>No!</i>

669
00:58:03,396 --> 00:58:04,562
<i>Look at her!</i>

670
00:58:04,646 --> 00:58:06,146
<i>No!</i>

671
00:58:06,229 --> 00:58:07,229
<i>What have we done?</i>

672
00:58:11,604 --> 00:58:13,354
Shit.

673
00:58:53,812 --> 00:58:56,104
Evelyn, where have you been?

674
00:58:56,187 --> 00:58:58,062
Why do you have that?

675
00:58:59,687 --> 00:59:01,437
You're scaring me.

676
00:59:02,854 --> 00:59:04,854
Please don't hurt me.

677
00:59:07,312 --> 00:59:09,562
Why are you following me?

678
00:59:10,771 --> 00:59:14,937
I was looking for you. Where were you?

679
00:59:15,979 --> 00:59:18,229
Do you remember anything?

680
00:59:18,312 --> 00:59:21,479
I remember some things.

681
00:59:22,937 --> 00:59:25,437
I had a dream about my mother,

682
00:59:26,687 --> 00:59:29,854
not long after she passed.

683
00:59:29,937 --> 00:59:33,729
We were making dinner together,
like every other night.

684
00:59:33,812 --> 00:59:36,604
And right in the middle,
she stopped

685
00:59:36,687 --> 00:59:38,396
and said she had to go.

686
00:59:38,479 --> 00:59:43,187
So I ran after her
to say goodbye,

687
00:59:44,729 --> 00:59:48,854
but she kept walking
like she didn't hear me.

688
00:59:48,937 --> 00:59:52,604
So I followed her,
but she was lost,

689
00:59:52,687 --> 00:59:56,604
disappeared into the fog.

690
00:59:59,812 --> 01:00:04,312
How do you know that?
I never told you that.

691
01:00:45,937 --> 01:00:48,437
I never told you that.

692
01:00:50,979 --> 01:00:55,229
Evelyn?
Stop, you're freaking me out.

693
01:01:03,437 --> 01:01:09,146
Jules? Jules.

694
01:01:14,479 --> 01:01:16,187
Mom?

695
01:01:23,812 --> 01:01:26,604
Can you come here, please?

696
01:01:30,104 --> 01:01:32,479
I missed you, <i>mija.</i>

697
01:01:32,562 --> 01:01:34,521
This can't...

698
01:01:34,604 --> 01:01:36,729
The last time I saw you was at the airport.

699
01:01:36,812 --> 01:01:41,354
We were saying goodbye
and the sunlight was shining behind you.

700
01:01:41,437 --> 01:01:43,604
- And it was so beautiful.
- You're not my mom.

701
01:01:43,687 --> 01:01:45,562
Oh, Jules,

702
01:01:45,646 --> 01:01:50,229
remember when you were five
and broke your arm?

703
01:01:50,312 --> 01:01:54,062
- Who fed you every meal?
- No. Stop it. Stop it. Please, stop.

704
01:01:54,146 --> 01:01:56,312
When you were 12 and
missed a month of school

705
01:01:56,396 --> 01:02:00,229
with pneumonia,
who nursed you back to health?

706
01:02:00,312 --> 01:02:02,521
Who cried with you
when your prom date

707
01:02:02,604 --> 01:02:04,271
didn't show up?

708
01:02:04,354 --> 01:02:07,896
- I held you. I comforted you.
- Stop.

709
01:02:07,979 --> 01:02:10,396
I was there for you. <i>- No puedo...</i>

710
01:02:10,479 --> 01:02:13,229
It's so cold here. - Stop it.

711
01:02:13,312 --> 01:02:15,771
Please.
Let me see you again.

712
01:02:15,854 --> 01:02:18,021
I said stop it!

713
01:02:20,812 --> 01:02:22,979
<i>Te quiero, mija.</i>

714
01:02:56,771 --> 01:02:57,771
Okay.

715
01:02:57,854 --> 01:02:59,812
Okay.

716
01:03:10,812 --> 01:03:13,229
Oh, okay.

717
01:03:23,812 --> 01:03:25,062
Okay.

718
01:03:33,479 --> 01:03:34,937
Okay.

719
01:03:43,104 --> 01:03:47,479
Oh, what is this?

720
01:04:03,604 --> 01:04:05,312
What is this?

721
01:04:42,979 --> 01:04:44,646
Evelyn!

722
01:04:44,729 --> 01:04:46,646
Way too late.
Time's over.

723
01:04:46,729 --> 01:04:48,354
Edgar, hold her!

724
01:04:49,854 --> 01:04:51,021
Please, hear us!

725
01:04:51,104 --> 01:04:52,771
Nobody's listening!

726
01:05:00,062 --> 01:05:01,729
Surrender her! Don't listen.

727
01:05:01,812 --> 01:05:04,104
By the power of God,
surrender her.

728
01:05:04,187 --> 01:05:07,146
You don't stand a chance!

729
01:05:12,687 --> 01:05:16,146
Oh, shit. Fuck!
I don't have my keys.

730
01:05:16,229 --> 01:05:17,729
I don't have my keys.

731
01:05:19,812 --> 01:05:20,812
Oh, huh, wait!

732
01:05:22,562 --> 01:05:24,979
Just get your fucking keys
and get outta here.

733
01:05:28,312 --> 01:05:33,146
Oh, God, thrust into Hell
Satan and all evil spirits

734
01:05:33,229 --> 01:05:37,229
who wander through the world
for the ruin of souls.

735
01:05:37,312 --> 01:05:38,396
Amen.

736
01:05:38,479 --> 01:05:39,979
Stupid priest.

737
01:05:40,062 --> 01:05:42,479
Evelyn, stop. Be careful!

738
01:05:42,562 --> 01:05:43,937
Get outta here!

739
01:05:44,021 --> 01:05:46,521
Evelyn, fight it.
I know you can.

740
01:05:46,604 --> 01:05:50,354
In the name of God, the Father,
Jesus Christ the Son,

741
01:05:50,437 --> 01:05:53,229
and by the power
of the Holy Spirit,

742
01:05:53,312 --> 01:05:55,854
you will obey me,
you foul thing.

743
01:05:55,937 --> 01:06:00,104
God cast you into a pit of
hellfire, into that pit you shall return.

744
01:06:00,187 --> 01:06:03,729
Oh, I can already
feel her suffering.

745
01:06:03,812 --> 01:06:05,896
Evelyn is stronger
than you will ever be.

746
01:06:05,979 --> 01:06:08,396
That's not
who I'm talking about.

747
01:06:08,479 --> 01:06:11,646
Your daughter
is in eternal torture, because of you.

748
01:06:11,729 --> 01:06:16,104
You failed her, but I,
I can bring her peace.

749
01:06:17,646 --> 01:06:19,271
Don't listen to it.

750
01:06:19,354 --> 01:06:21,034
Leave the flesh
of God's righteous creature

751
01:06:21,062 --> 01:06:24,771
and return to the darkness
from whence you came!

752
01:06:24,854 --> 01:06:30,021
Ah, your souls or hers!

753
01:06:30,104 --> 01:06:35,104
- Little Sarah's blossoming into a lovely woman.
- Shut your mouth, demon!

754
01:06:35,187 --> 01:06:38,354
Oh, you should be honored
to have made

755
01:06:38,437 --> 01:06:40,604
such a precious sacrifice
for me.

756
01:06:40,687 --> 01:06:43,479
I have them both now,
and Evelyn has given up

757
01:06:43,562 --> 01:06:46,479
her defiance
and replaced it with screams.

758
01:06:46,562 --> 01:06:48,354
It's a sweet symphony!

759
01:06:48,437 --> 01:06:49,479
Evie, fight it.

760
01:06:49,562 --> 01:06:51,521
You're stronger than this thing.

761
01:06:51,604 --> 01:06:54,104
You told me that you
found a way and you did.

762
01:06:54,187 --> 01:06:56,479
But I need your help,
so fight it.

763
01:06:56,562 --> 01:06:58,979
Fight it for her!
Fight it for all of us!

764
01:07:00,937 --> 01:07:03,854
The blood of Christ
seals the cage.

765
01:07:03,937 --> 01:07:07,896
By all that's holy in the power
of the Kingdom of Heaven,

766
01:07:07,979 --> 01:07:12,229
I banish you!
Return to your prison.

767
01:07:13,812 --> 01:07:15,687
Your soul's it is.

768
01:07:52,687 --> 01:07:54,771
Make it stop.

769
01:09:53,729 --> 01:09:55,854
What have you done, Evelyn?

770
01:10:06,812 --> 01:10:08,729
You can't leave.

771
01:10:08,812 --> 01:10:10,646
We need to get you
to a hospital.

772
01:10:10,729 --> 01:10:12,021
Come on, let's get you
to my car.

773
01:10:12,104 --> 01:10:13,437
I can't.

774
01:10:13,521 --> 01:10:16,854
Just try
or you'll bleed to death.

775
01:10:16,937 --> 01:10:18,604
Please, help me save her.

776
01:10:18,687 --> 01:10:20,854
What is wrong with you people?

777
01:10:20,937 --> 01:10:22,646
When this is over, bury it.

778
01:10:22,729 --> 01:10:24,187
What?

779
01:10:24,271 --> 01:10:27,729
When everything is done,
put it in the ground.

780
01:10:27,812 --> 01:10:29,646
It's just like in the basement.

781
01:10:29,729 --> 01:10:31,562
Like, what these?

782
01:10:32,812 --> 01:10:34,062
Yeah.

783
01:10:34,146 --> 01:10:35,062
And then... and then...
and then,

784
01:10:35,146 --> 01:10:36,604
there were these letters.

785
01:10:36,687 --> 01:10:39,604
E-L-I-M.

786
01:10:40,687 --> 01:10:41,979
Elim.

787
01:10:42,979 --> 01:10:45,146
What does it mean?

788
01:10:45,229 --> 01:10:46,646
We need to hurry.

789
01:10:48,479 --> 01:10:50,021
No. No, please, let me go.

790
01:10:50,104 --> 01:10:51,854
You can't go.

791
01:10:51,937 --> 01:10:54,229
My dad needs me.

792
01:10:54,312 --> 01:10:57,312
Don't let Evelyn die alone.

793
01:10:59,437 --> 01:11:00,896
Come with me.

794
01:11:00,979 --> 01:11:04,854
Listen, a Christian
ritual's satanic,

795
01:11:04,937 --> 01:11:07,771
but if Elim seals the cage,

796
01:11:07,854 --> 01:11:11,146
Satanism names our power.

797
01:11:11,229 --> 01:11:13,854
I can kill this thing.

798
01:11:13,937 --> 01:11:15,562
I don't wanna do it.

799
01:11:30,187 --> 01:11:32,271
No, I don't wanna...
I don't wanna do it.

800
01:11:34,312 --> 01:11:37,021
It should be a perfect fit.

801
01:11:37,104 --> 01:11:39,979
Where do we... wait.

802
01:11:40,062 --> 01:11:42,729
Where are you...

803
01:11:42,812 --> 01:11:43,854
Where are you going?

804
01:11:47,354 --> 01:11:48,771
Just let me leave.

805
01:11:48,854 --> 01:11:49,854
Please.

806
01:11:55,437 --> 01:11:56,687
No!

807
01:12:13,812 --> 01:12:17,937
Julia? Oh, Julia?

808
01:12:20,896 --> 01:12:25,146
Don't be afraid, darling Julia.

809
01:12:25,229 --> 01:12:29,312
Your mother wasn't.

810
01:12:29,396 --> 01:12:33,771
She wasn’t afraid to die.
She was heartbroken.

811
01:12:35,229 --> 01:12:38,354
And I know her pain.

812
01:12:42,812 --> 01:12:45,354
You don't know my mother.

813
01:12:45,437 --> 01:12:48,021
I know her suffering.

814
01:12:48,104 --> 01:12:51,354
And soon you'll have yours!

815
01:12:51,437 --> 01:12:53,062
Go away!

816
01:13:25,187 --> 01:13:26,354
Okay.

817
01:13:26,437 --> 01:13:27,729
We're doing...

818
01:13:43,729 --> 01:13:45,437
Where did it go?

819
01:13:45,521 --> 01:13:47,979
Where does it fucking fit?

820
01:13:53,729 --> 01:13:55,729
What am I supposed to do?

821
01:14:04,187 --> 01:14:08,979
Oh, no, we won't be
needing that anymore.

822
01:14:14,187 --> 01:14:15,812
Tell me, Julia,

823
01:14:15,896 --> 01:14:19,771
would you trade your soul
for hers?

824
01:14:19,854 --> 01:14:21,729
I'm not cutting
any deals with you!

825
01:14:21,812 --> 01:14:24,729
You've abandoned her
like your mother.

826
01:14:30,854 --> 01:14:36,771
The human body is much more fun
than a little statue.

827
01:14:36,854 --> 01:14:39,146
And this one is very tired.

828
01:14:39,229 --> 01:14:40,396
Let her go!

829
01:14:40,479 --> 01:14:42,146
I intend to.

830
01:14:43,229 --> 01:14:44,979
What do you want?

831
01:14:45,062 --> 01:14:48,187
Right now, you!

832
01:15:09,229 --> 01:15:12,729
Sarah doesn't blame you.

833
01:15:16,229 --> 01:15:19,854
It was never your fault.

834
01:15:53,812 --> 01:15:57,062
We did it. We did it.

835
01:15:58,979 --> 01:16:00,687
I'm free.

836
01:16:09,937 --> 01:16:13,854
I think I need a hospital.

837
01:16:17,479 --> 01:16:21,104
Wait, I don't, I don't feel...

838
01:16:27,187 --> 01:16:29,104
What's happening?

839
01:16:29,187 --> 01:16:33,104
I'm sorry.
It has to be this way.

840
01:16:34,604 --> 01:16:36,437
What are you doing?

841
01:16:40,604 --> 01:16:44,354
The only way is if it dies
inside a living vessel.

842
01:16:48,854 --> 01:16:50,937
I have to do it now
while it's weak.

843
01:16:52,062 --> 01:16:54,104
Or before I forget.

844
01:16:56,562 --> 01:16:57,562
Please.

845
01:17:00,062 --> 01:17:05,354
You have been the answer
to all my prayers.

846
01:17:11,229 --> 01:17:12,229
No!

847
01:17:15,729 --> 01:17:18,854
Please, don't kill me!

848
01:17:18,937 --> 01:17:20,729
Not again!

849
01:17:29,729 --> 01:17:31,146
No!

850
01:17:31,229 --> 01:17:32,979
Please, stop!

851
01:17:38,604 --> 01:17:40,687
Please, don't!

852
01:17:42,312 --> 01:17:44,146
Please, don't kill me!

853
01:17:44,229 --> 01:17:46,104
Help me!

854
01:17:48,562 --> 01:17:50,937
Mommy!

855
01:17:51,812 --> 01:17:54,812
Help! Please, help!

856
01:17:55,479 --> 01:17:57,562
Help! Please, help!

857
01:17:58,687 --> 01:18:01,104
Mommy, please help!

858
01:18:01,187 --> 01:18:04,687
Evelyn, what are you doing?

859
01:18:07,187 --> 01:18:08,521
Help, help!

860
01:18:08,604 --> 01:18:12,896
You cannot bury me again.

861
01:18:19,854 --> 01:18:21,229
Evelyn!

862
01:18:21,312 --> 01:18:22,896
Don't!

863
01:18:43,146 --> 01:18:48,562
<i>♪ Take the name of Jesus
with you ♪</i>

864
01:18:48,646 --> 01:18:54,229
<i>♪ Child of sorrow and of woe ♪</i>

865
01:18:54,312 --> 01:18:59,896
<i>♪ It will joy
and comfort give you ♪</i>

866
01:18:59,979 --> 01:19:04,979
<i>♪ Take it then
wherever you go ♪</i>

867
01:19:05,062 --> 01:19:07,479
<i>- ♪ Precious name ♪
- ♪ Precious name ♪</i>

868
01:19:07,562 --> 01:19:10,479
<i>- ♪ Oh, how sweet ♪
- ♪ Oh, how sweet ♪</i>

869
01:19:10,562 --> 01:19:14,021
<i>♪ Hope of Earth
and joy of Heav'n... ♪</i>

